# Garlic Bread Appetizer

## Ingredients

 1 Stick of butter

(softened)

 5 Cloves of Sardo Hot Pickled Garlic

 ⅓ cup Parmesan cheese

(shredded)

 ⅓ cup Monterey Jack cheese

(shredded)

 ⅓ cup Cheddar cheese

(shredded)

 ⅓ Fresh green onions

(chopped)

 1 Baguette

## Directions

Preheat oven to 400°F

2

In a bowl, combine all list ingredients and mix.

3

Slice the baguette lengthwise in half.

4

Spread the mixture evenly all over the open face sides of the baguette.

5

Bake for 15 minutes or until the edges start to brown.

6

Slice about 1- inch thick bite-sized pieces.

7

Serve & Enjoy!

